    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1233">

                <pb facs="1209" n="1043" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg1043"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.63/367</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Fletcher to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico City</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-02-19T14:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 19, 1917, 2 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2. Your February 17, 5 p.m. By decree of the Minister of Fomento dated February
                    16, the mining interests which have explained to said Minister the causes which
                    have prevented them from complying with the decrees of September 14 and November
                    14, will be granted a further last extension to be fixed by the said Ministry
                    according to the circumstances of each particular case.</p>
                <p>The mining interests which have not asked for any extension will be intervened by
                    the Ministry of Finance as soon as their properties may be declared forfeited by
                    the Ministry of Fomento which will prepare and send to the Ministry of Finance a
                    list of the names of each and every one of the claims or properties to be
                    intervened.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Fletcher</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
